                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9adf35a-b50d-36f8-b9e2-54e5791c5a53",
                        "entry_id": "d4748be5-9191-363e-879c-8eea57fc3cb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having quills or similar structures."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cab8910b-128e-433a-831e-1e2477e6f7b9",
                                "sense_id": "a9adf35a-b50d-36f8-b9e2-54e5791c5a53",
                                "text": "In Ireland have I seen this stubborn Cade\nOppose himself against a troop of kerns,\nAnd fought so long till that his thighs with darts\nWere almost like a sharp-quill'd porpentine;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c81cf90-d6c3-4448-ba6d-71522aaca219",
                                "sense_id": "a9adf35a-b50d-36f8-b9e2-54e5791c5a53",
                                "text": "He leaned down to inspect a white-quilled cactus, and then spotted a different kind with skinnier branches and only a few drab spines."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93f33d53-233d-4125-ab87-721ccce6ce71",
                                "sense_id": "a9adf35a-b50d-36f8-b9e2-54e5791c5a53",
                                "text": "A quilled lionfish was face to face with a saurian moray eel, sizing it up before swimming on."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c5ce66f9-abd9-36b4-a16a-3cd6bfc14e3c",
                        "entry_id": "d4748be5-9191-363e-879c-8eea57fc3cb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having long, narrow petals or florets."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of a flower"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "060ff91a-89c8-4fa4-a054-b12170ae912d",
                                "sense_id": "c5ce66f9-abd9-36b4-a16a-3cd6bfc14e3c",
                                "text": "In the wild state the flowers are single—that is to say, only the outer florets are strap-shaped, and usually of a rosy-lilac tint, with yellowish disc florets; but under cultivation, all the florets have become ligulate or quilled […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0fc8aa5d-edbf-3a65-92ce-a7e02481d449",
                        "entry_id": "d4748be5-9191-363e-879c-8eea57fc3cb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Created through the process of quilling."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ddd11078-1b1c-3924-b884-185f48201938",
                        "entry_id": "d4748be5-9191-363e-879c-8eea57fc3cb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having small, rounded folds."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of fabric"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6272508-3f35-4f60-84ae-3dfd1e5c9ec3",
                                "sense_id": "ddd11078-1b1c-3924-b884-185f48201938",
                                "text": "Round the throat is a ruff of white muslin, quilled in large reverse plaids; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdb0e3c0-2187-4a4a-8b82-fd7abdbc3f05",
                                "sense_id": "ddd11078-1b1c-3924-b884-185f48201938",
                                "text": "He insensibly began to alter his appearance; his cravat seemed quilled into a ruff, and his breeches swelled out into a farlingale. I now fancied him changing sexes; and as my eyes began to close in slumber, I imagined my fat landlord actually converted into as fat a landlady."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0909a4b2-8903-32fe-ad36-2c1afa6a21c6",
                        "entry_id": "d4748be5-9191-363e-879c-8eea57fc3cb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Decorated with quillwork."
                        ],
